* No `Lean.ofReduceBool`/`native_decide`. The `…._native.decide.ax_1` axioms are
  the string-length side conditions baked into the generated constant
  DEFINITIONS in `Funs.lean`: `field.MODULUS` / `MODULUS_255_DISTANCE` /
  `TWO_MODULUS_255_DISTANCE` are the pre-existing field-layer ones (README
  §5c.3), while `point.selene.B` / `point.selene.G_Y` entered with the Selene
  translation scope (README §5c.3 / `human_audit_assumptions.txt` VIII.3).
  Every statement mentioning those constants inherits them; each asserts only
  that a hex-string literal is at most `U32.max` bytes, and the Spec tree
  re-proves all the parsed VALUES with kernel `decide` (`MODULUS_ok` in
  `Spec/Externals.lean`, `B_ok`/`G_Y_ok` in `Spec/Selene/Curve.lean`).
